## Step 2 — SCSS (resource/scss/pages/_main.scss)

기존 `no-main-why` 블록 전체 교체. 제거 대상:
`__body`, `__visual`, `__stage`, `__showcase`, `__ring`, `__card`, `__card-media`, `__card-image`

신규 스타일:

```scss
.no-main-why {
  width: 100%;
  background: transparent;

  &__wrap {
    min-height: var(--scene-shell-span);
    position: relative;
  }

  &__inner {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-base), visibility var(--transition-base);

    &.is-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
    }
  }

  // 스킬 리스트
  &__skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  &__skill-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--gutter-lg);
    padding: fluid(14, 22) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--clr-border-strong);
    cursor: default;
    position: relative;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-base);

    &:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--clr-border-strong); }

    // 비활성 아이템 dimming
    .no-main-why__skill-list:has(.no-main-why__skill-item:hover) &:not(:hover) {
      opacity: 0.28;
    }
  }

  &__skill-num {
    color: var(--clr-text-tertiary);
    min-width: fluid(24, 32);
  }

  &__skill-label {
    flex: 1;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  &__skill-tag {
    color: var(--clr-text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  // 비디오 프리뷰 패널 (왼쪽 고정)
  &__preview {
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%;
    left: fluid(24, 48);
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0.92);
    width: fluid(180, 260);
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition:
      opacity 0.3s ease,
      visibility 0.3s ease,
      transform 0.3s ease;
    z-index: 10;

    &.is-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1);
    }

    &.is-closing {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0.92);
    }
  }

  &__preview-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
}
```

